 "mdw-ho-024": "The repository tool enumerates every six-dish meal and does not finish. Independent check: a lower bound on the one-cook meal time, taking the fastest pool dish for each of the six required roles and ignoring every other constraint and distinctness, is 10+10+10+8+8+10 = 56 hands-on minutes (prep + half the cook time) + 0 longest waiting + 5 x 5 switch-over minutes = 81 minutes, above the 60-minute limit, so no valid dinner exists.",
